        "Description": "Good morning 47,\r\ryour targets are 2 sons of the Yakuza leaders. Interpol has started an investigation about recent assassination of politicians in Japan. So far from our source inside the Interpol, we know that all these assassinations were executed and performed by your targets. Since the heat started, your targets seeked refuge in the private GAMA hospital trough Yuki Yamazaki with Yakuza Bodyguards. Our clients are families of the assassinated politicians and are seeking justice.\r\rGood luck",
